Storybound artwork
------------------
The following textures are original pixel art drawn for Storybound by the author
in Aseprite; their sources are in the aseprite/ directory:

- textures/gui/journal/adventure_book.png (the Adventure Menu book)
- textures/gui/document/*.png (the book, scroll, letter, note and contract)
- textures/gui/observation/bar.png
- textures/item/document_*.png (the document items and the book's model)

The palette they use is in aseprite/palette/. The book item follows the vanilla
Minecraft book; Minecraft-derived elements are not claimed as original
Storybound intellectual property.

The following textures are original assets generated for Storybound with the
built-in OpenAI imagegen tool, using only the project's own artwork and
concepts as references:

- textures/gui/journal/traveler_corner.png
- textures/gui/dialogue/parchment.png, frame.png and ornaments.png
  (the frame and ornaments are extracted from the generated dialogue concept)
- textures/gui/dialogue/nebula.png (reduced to a four-colour pixel grid and
  exported as animation cels)

BookmarkPixels and JournalSkin draw original pixel emblems, cloth ribbons,
reward glints, an XP orb and printed rules. No Minecraft item textures are
bundled as UI icons.

Fonts
-----
The active Adventure Menu font is minecraft:default, resolved at runtime.
Minecraft font files are not copied into this repository or the mod jar.
Resource packs may replace the runtime font. The retired journal font ids
remain as aliases to minecraft:default. The separate document font aliases
minecraft:uniform.

